      "disposition": "active",
      "notes": "Completes the flow: redeems the pending login once, exchanges the code through the module, resolves roles, provisions the user just in time, fills IdP-sourced approver pools, opens the session, sets the pm_session cookie, 302 to return_to. 400 login_state_unknown | login_rejected | idp_error."
