        "apps/pm-frontend/app/page.tsx"
      ],
      "disposition": "active",
      "notes": "Starts the SSO code flow through IdPi_OIDC (\u00a704): mints the nonce, stores the pending login (state, verifier, return_to) in Redis, 302 to the IdP. 503 idp_unavailable when the module or IdP is down."
    },
